name's house, Shun, and his friends decided to cut Shun's hair. While preparing to study, they then talk about when did Kaname started wearing glasses.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8rNL6XMn8a73O2FDTxgFET6ZWWU.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8367","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45195","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"252467","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"25870","synopsis":"Chizuru, Kaname, Yuuki and Shun saw an unexpected confession of a quiet and shy girl to Yuuta. Even so, Yuuta does not tell any information regarding the incident to his friends. This results to the gang stalking Yuuta behind his back while he was on a supposed 'date' with her. In the end, it is revealed that Yuuta had known about the girl's situation all along; being bullied by her friends and wants to help her, even if it meant accepting her confession. The relationship between Yuuta and the girl, Takahashi-san is still unclear. However, at the end she and Yuuta broke up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z33gu0MtqViX09m6954L9WWnSiF.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Chizuru, Kaname, Yuuki and Shun saw an unexpected confession of a quiet and shy girl to Yuuta. Even so, Yuuta does not tell any information regarding the incident to his friends. This results to the gang stalking Yuuta behind his back while he was on a supposed 'date' with her. In the end, it is revealed that Yuuta had known about the girl's situation all along; being bullied by her friends and wants to help her, even if it meant accepting her confession. The relationship between Yuuta and the girl, Takahashi-san is still unclear. However, at the end she and Yuuta broke up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z33gu0MtqViX09m6954L9WWnSiF.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8367","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45195","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"252467","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"25871","synopsis":"Yuuki has been asked by a first year student named Ryunosuke Matsushita, who is a member of the Manga Society of their school to draw a five-page manga for the club's anthology. After accepting this, Yuuki decides to divide his work with his friends namely: Yuuta working on the first page, Yuuki on second, Shun on third, Chizuru on fourth and Kaname on the last page. When they were all finished with their work, Chizuru asked Yuuki to make copies for everyone. Yuuki attempted to shred it to bits but was stopped by Chizuru and Kaname. On the side story of the episode, it reveals that Ryunosuke Matsushita admires Yuuki and thinks of him as his \"hero\".","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pXDS18vQGWeZAgEqaSN20e5KXmZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Yuuki has been asked by a first year student named Ryunosuke Matsushita, who is a member of the Manga Society of their school to draw a five-page manga for the club's anthology. After accepting this, Yuuki decides to divide his work with his friends namely: Yuuta working on the first page, Yuuki on second, Shun on third, Chizuru on fourth and Kaname on the last page. When they were all finished with their work, Chizuru asked Yuuki to make copies for everyone. Yuuki attempted to shred it to bits but was stopped by Chizuru and Kaname. On the side story of the episode, it reveals that Ryunosuke Matsushita admires Yuuki and thinks of him as his \"hero\".","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pXDS18vQGWeZAgEqaSN20e5KXmZ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8367","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45195","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"252467","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"25872","synopsis":"In a matter of days, the Homare High School Cultural Festival will start. Everyone is busy their preparations and also having fun in between. In this episode, we see how Kaname handles his day with his friends which frustrates him a lot and also his duties as a student council member.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yMcdv7FBxXv44a5wkoGf0al19dU.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"In a matter of days, the Homare High School Cultural Festival will start. Everyone is busy their preparations and also having fun in between. In this episode, we see how Kaname handles his day with his friends which frustrates him a lot and also his duties as a student council member.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yMcdv7FBxXv44a5wkoGf0al19dU.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8367","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45195","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"252467","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"25873","synopsis":"It's finally the day of the Cultural Festival and everyone prepares for their respective groups. Shun's class are doing a \"cafe with a twist\" and Kaname's class are doing a \"stereotypical haunted house\". In Masaki's class, they are going to play Cinderella on stage. Even if her role is a mouse, she is desperate to practice her dialogue. The gang watches her performance however, some of them are still wearing their costumes, which made Masaki to notice them easily, got nervous and accidentally mixed her lines up. Chizuru goes to comfort her after her performance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dH9lZLpkU2Y3RMVDUeGaUNSaYGM.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"It's finally the day of the Cultural Festival and everyone prepares for their respective groups. Shun's class are doing a \"cafe with a twist\" and Kaname's class are doing a \"stereotypical haunted house\". In Masaki's class, they are going to play Cinderella on stage. Even if her role is a mouse, she is desperate to practice her dialogue. The gang watches her performance however, some of them are still wearing their costumes, which made Masaki to notice them easily, got nervous and accidentally mixed her lines up. Chizuru goes to comfort her after her performance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dH9lZLpkU2Y3RMVDUeGaUNSaYGM.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8367","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"10460","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45195","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"252467","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"25877","syn